        "text": "After the wedding, Melos started back. Rain fell hard all night. By morning, dark water covered the bridge. He could not wait. His friend's life depended on him. Melos jumped into the river. The water pulled him under. He fought to reach the other side. At last, he caught a tree branch and pulled himself out. Cold and wet, he ran on. Three men blocked the road."
